    {
      "_id": "fld_payments",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_payment_api",
      "name": "Pagamentos",
      "metaSortKey": 1
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_create_pix",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_payments",
      "name": "Criar pagamento PIX",
      "description": "Cria o registro com status PENDING. Não passa pelo Temporal nem pelo Mercado Pago.\n\nResposta 201:\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c656901b-0e57-4957-8fb3-675d54d68580\",\n  \"cpf\": \"12345678901\",\n  \"description\": \"Assinatura mensal\",\n  \"amount\": 100,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"PIX\",\n  \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-17T17:51:50.911Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-17T17:51:50.911Z\"\n}\n```",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/payment",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/json"
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"cpf\": \"{{ _.cpf }}\",\n  \"description\": \"Assinatura mensal\",\n  \"amount\": 100.00,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"PIX\"\n}"
      },
      "metaSortKey": 0
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_create_card",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_payments",
      "name": "Criar pagamento Cartão de Crédito",
      "description": "Inicia um workflow no Temporal, cria a preferência no Mercado Pago e retorna o `initPoint` (link de checkout). O workflow fica aguardando o webhook por até 30 minutos.\n\nAcompanhe em {{ _.base_url }}/temporal/\n\nResposta 201:\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"ca6e24f8-01d3-4368-9dbf-890357ef500b\",\n  \"cpf\": \"12345678901\",\n  \"description\": \"Teste cartao\",\n  \"amount\": 50,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"CREDIT_CARD\",\n  \"status\": \"PENDING\",\n  \"initPoint\": \"https://sandbox.mercadopago.com.br/checkout/v1/redirect?pref_id=...\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-17T19:13:44.007Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-09-17T19:13:44.007Z\"\n}\n```",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/payment",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/json"
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"cpf\": \"{{ _.cpf }}\",\n  \"description\": \"Teste cartao\",\n  \"amount\": 50.00,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"CREDIT_CARD\"\n}"
      },
      "metaSortKey": 1
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_list",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_payments",
      "name": "Listar pagamentos",
      "description": "Filtros opcionais: `cpf` (11 dígitos) e `paymentMethod` (PIX ou CREDIT_CARD). Desative os parâmetros para listar tudo.",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/payment",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "cpf",
          "value": "{{ _.cpf }}",
          "disabled": false
        },
        {
          "name": "paymentMethod",
          "value": "PIX",
          "disabled": true
        }
      ],
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "application/json"
        }
      ],
      "metaSortKey": 2
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_get_by_id",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_payments",
      "name": "Buscar pagamento por ID",
      "description": "Retorna 404 se o UUID não existir e 400 se não for um UUID válido. Preencha `payment_id` no ambiente ou substitua na URL.",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/payment/{{ _.payment_id }}",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "application/json"
        }
      ],
      "metaSortKey": 3
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_update",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_payments",
      "name": "Atualizar status do pagamento",
      "description": "Status aceitos: PENDING, PAID, FAIL.",
      "method": "PUT",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/payment/{{ _.payment_id }}",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/json"
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"status\": \"PAID\"\n}"
      },
      "metaSortKey": 4
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_create_invalid",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_payments",
      "name": "Exemplo de erro de validação (400)",
      "description": "CPF com 10 dígitos, valor negativo e método inválido. Mostra as mensagens de validação em português.",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/payment",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/json"
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"cpf\": \"1234567890\",\n  \"description\": \"ab\",\n  \"amount\": -5,\n  \"paymentMethod\": \"BOLETO\"\n}"
      },
      "metaSortKey": 5
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_webhook",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_payment_api",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "metaSortKey": 2
    },
    {
      "_id": "req_webhook",
      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_webhook",
      "name": "Webhook Mercado Pago (simulação)",
      "description": "Simula a notificação do Mercado Pago para completar o workflow.\n\nComo usar:\n1. Crie um pagamento CREDIT_CARD e copie o `pref_id` da URL do `initPoint` (ex.: 62917950-cfecc2d0-1062-4144-b7d5-0cdfa397f137).\n2. Cole em `preference_id` no ambiente (ou direto em `data.id`).\n3. Envie com `action` = `payment.approved` (vira PAID) ou `payment.rejected` (vira FAIL).\n\nA API localiza o pagamento pelo `externalId` (= id da preferência), sinaliza o workflow no Temporal e ele termina como Completed. Sempre responde 200 `{ \"received\": true }`.",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/api/webhook/mercado-pago",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/json"
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "mimeType": "application/json",
        "text": "{\n  \"id\": 12345,\n  \"live_mode\": false,\n  \"type\": \"payment\",\n  \"date_created\": \"2026-09-17T19:13:44.007Z\",\n  \"user_id\": 44444,\n  \"api_version\": \"v1\",\n  \"action\": \"payment.approved\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{ _.preference_id }}\"\n  }\n}"
      },
      "metaSortKey": 0
    },
    {
      "_id": "fld_docs",
      "_type": "request_group",
      "parentId": "wrk_payment_api",
      "name": "Documentação",
      "metaSortKey": 3
